==Battleground==
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 1.67~5 seconds<sup>50f~150f</sup>.

==Strategy==
One Horn isn't too hard to kill and acts as a nice source of cash. Otherwise, [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] such as [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sushi Cat]] are also good here.

